  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement PreadmissionCapabilityStatement</b></p><a name=\"PreadmissionCapabilityStatement\"> </a><a name=\"hcPreadmissionCapabilityStatement\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">Capacités serveur FHIR pour l'IG Preadmission</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 1.0.0-ballot </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>json</code></li><li>Published on: 2025-05-22 </li><li>Published by: Interop'Santé </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"/></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"DELETE a resource (delete interaction)\">D</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#Encounter1-1\">Encounter</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-encounter-fr.html\">https://hl7.fr/ig/fhir/preadmission/StructureDefinition/preadmission-encounter-fr</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td>preadmission-status, patient, date, appointment, _lastUpdated</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Appointment1-2\">Appointment</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-appointment-fr.html\">https://hl7.fr/ig/fhir/preadmission/StructureDefinition/preadmission-appointment-fr</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>patient, date</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Consent1-3\">Consent</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-consent-fr.html\">https://hl7.fr/ig/fhir/preadmission/StructureDefinition/preadmission-consent-fr</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>patient</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Coverage1-4\">Coverage</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-coverage-fr.html\">https://hl7.fr/ig/fhir/preadmission/StructureDefinition/preadmission-coverage-fr</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>patient</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#DocumentReference1-5\">DocumentReference</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-documentreference-fr.html\">https://hl7.fr/ig/fhir/preadmission/StructureDefinition/preadmission-documentreference-fr</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>encounter, patient</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Patient1-6\">Patient</a></td><td> </td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td/><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#QuestionnaireResponse1-7\">QuestionnaireResponse</a></td><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-questionnaireresponse-fr.html\">https://hl7.fr/ig/fhir/preadmission/StructureDefinition/preadmission-questionnaireresponse-fr</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>subject, patient</td><td/><td/><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Encounter1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Encounter</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-encounter-fr.html\">Fr Preadmission Encounter Profile</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>, <code>create</code>, <code>update</code>, <code>delete</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"SearchParameter-encounter-preadmission-status.html\">preadmission-status</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche des préadmission par son statut (extension PreadmissionStatutFr).</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>patient</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche par patient associé</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>date</td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche par date de l'Encounter</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>appointment</td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche des préadmissions par rendez-vous</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/resource.html#search\">_lastUpdated</a></td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche par date de dernière mise à jour de l'Encounter</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Appointment1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Appointment</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-preadmission-appointment-fr.html\">Fr Preadmission Appointment Profile</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>read</code>, <code>search-type</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/appointment.html#search\">patient</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche des rendez-vous par patient</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/appointment.html#search\">date</a></td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Le serveur DOIT permettre la recherche des rendez-vous par date</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Consent1-3\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: unspecified </span>Consent</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg